{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snack Shop Simulator</strong> is a first-person simulation game where your snack shop grows stronger the more you eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/76343502dd8ea4428c34cab11cba6bff.avif?t=1760120060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras_big/76343502dd8ea4428c34cab11cba6bff.webp?t=1760120060 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game PC to order from <strong>45+ different snacks</strong>. Decide: eat them to gain power, or stock them in your shop to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/53dabca330af32ac40961dab4f51d438.avif?t=1760120060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras_big/53dabca330af32ac40961dab4f51d438.webp?t=1760120060 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place shelves anywhere you like, then fill each slot with your chosen snacks to create the perfect layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/ff8a6b4e93f92a59c1f7a9ea620fd0e9.avif?t=1760120060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras_big/ff8a6b4e93f92a59c1f7a9ea620fd0e9.webp?t=1760120060 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating snacks isn\u2019t just tasty\u2014it makes you and employees faster and more efficient.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock shelves in a flash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out customers at lightning speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees can be powered up by feeding them  snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire or Do It Yourself</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to handle the hard work\u2014or roll up your sleeves and take on the roles yourself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cashier</strong> \u2013 speed through customer checkouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restocker</strong> \u2013 keep shelves filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeder</strong> \u2013 hand out snacks to supercharge co-workers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manager</strong> \u2013 oversee your growing empire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Snack Heaven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build a thriving business, or snack your way to success? The choice is yours!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952620?t=1760120060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952620?t=1760120060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/20416c0b23816025a73f7f2c7fb824232f99e0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760120060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952